#: hmib_types.php
msgid "The Host Type is determined by scanning its snmp agent for the sysObjectID and sysDescription and comparing it against values in the Host Types database.  The first match that is found in the database is used aggregate Host data.  Therefore, it is very important that you select valid sysObjectID, sysDescrMatch for your Hosts."
msgstr "Nooca Martigeliyaha waxaa lagu go'aamiyaa iyadoo la baaro wakiilkiisa snmp si loo helo sysObjectID iyo sysDescription loona barbardhigo qiimaha ku jira kaydka xogta Noocyada Martigeliyaha.  Iswaafajinta ugu horreysa ee laga helo kaydka xogta ayaa loo isticmaalaa ururinta xogta Martigeliyaha.  Sidaa darteed, aad bay muhiim u tahay inaad u doorato sysObjectID, sysDescrMatch ansax ah Martigeliyeyaashaada."

